{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":489870,"name":"Kiefer Menard","username":"Kiefer_Menard","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/k/df788c/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-13T08:27:13.892Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489870-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489870-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489870-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489870-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e2 days ago my bots randomly stopped responding or running routines. Tried restarting the app and even tried on different devices. Instead whenever I message them I get an error saying “Bot failed to respond. Something went wrong while generating the reply. Try again.”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489870-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489870-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStarted happening all of a sudden and has been happening continuously for the last 36 hours.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489870-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489870-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExpected a response from the bots.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489870-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489870-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/2/a/2a80a0bdb80f9a9fced7cf7908d8218566cdf3a4.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/63ZDxwjFie6CRAnGxBWOr8YdrcU.png?dl=1\" title=\"Screenshot 2026-09-13 at 1.22.06 AM.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/2/a/2a80a0bdb80f9a9fced7cf7908d8218566cdf3a4_2_690x83.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-13 at 1.22.06 AM.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"63ZDxwjFie6CRAnGxBWOr8YdrcU\" width=\"690\" height=\"83\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/2/a/2a80a0bdb80f9a9fced7cf7908d8218566cdf3a4_2_690x83.png, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/2/a/2a80a0bdb80f9a9fced7cf7908d8218566cdf3a4_2_1035x124.png 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/2/a/2a80a0bdb80f9a9fced7cf7908d8218566cdf3a4_2_1380x166.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"231B1C\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eScreenshot 2026-09-13 at 1.22.06 AM.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1512×182 13.1 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489870-operating-system-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489870-operating-system-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489870-version-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489870-version-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot:\u003cbr\u003e\nVersion: 0.47.0\u003cbr\u003e\nRelease Track: stable\u003cbr\u003e\nOS: darwin\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489870-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489870-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: add Request ID with privacy disabled\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e36960df6-4b3e-4641-9ac6-5f8130a10678\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489870-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-9\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489870-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-9\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes - Cursor is unusable\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-13T10:14:41.131Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":9,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":45.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":171481,"topic_slug":"bots-failing-to-respond","display_username":"Kiefer Menard","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":137568,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/bots-failing-to-respond/171481/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":489915,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-13T09:47:17.934Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for the detailed report. Your Mac and other devices are fine, the issue isn’t on your side.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAll your bots and their routines run on one shared Grok Bot computer on our side, and that computer stopped responding. The app can still see that computer’s screen, but it can’t reach the part that generates replies. That’s why you get “Bot failed to respond” on every message. Restarting the app or switching devices won’t fix it, so there’s no point retrying the send.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe fastest fix is to rebuild that computer. Your bots, chats, files, and logins will stay:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFully quit Grok Bot with \u003ccode\u003eCmd+Q\u003c/code\u003e, then open it again.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Settings the gear icon, then go to Updates.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eClick “Reset Grok Bot’s Computer” and confirm.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWait for it to finish, usually a couple of minutes, then send a short test message in a new chat.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImportant: don’t use “Update Grok Bot’s Computer” right now. In this state it won’t complete.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf Reset shows “Reset failed” or “partial state”, reply here and we’ll rebuild the computer from our side. Messages that didn’t go through over the weekend will stay marked as failed, so just resend the ones you still need.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLet me know how it goes.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-13T09:47:17.934Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":0.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":171481,"topic_slug":"bots-failing-to-respond","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":